From: banst <bastien@banst.ch>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 10:15:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] pod: player SELECT scrubs the track

---
 apps/gui/skin_engine/skin_tokens.c |  4 ++
 apps/gui/wps.c                     | 99 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 apps/gui/wps.h                     |  1 +
 lib/skin_parser/tag_table.c        |  1 +
 lib/skin_parser/tag_table.h        |  1 +
 5 files changed, 106 insertions(+)

diff --git a/apps/gui/skin_engine/skin_tokens.c b/apps/gui/skin_engine/skin_tokens.c
index b18eedc99cdb61e9ca89e2e7d045ea8a8aa61372..0e3a04d5e3c935c2aa79c7aa991b08e7cde70b9d 100644
